=== Partition pruning: a private-sector query touches only the local partition ===
                                QUERY PLAN                                
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Aggregate
   ->  Seq Scan on finding_geo_private finding_geo
         Filter: ((sector = 'private'::text) AND (status = 'open'::text))
(3 rows)


=== A public-sector query is sent to the Abuja node (Foreign Scan + Remote SQL) ===
                                                          QUERY PLAN                                                           
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 GroupAggregate
   Output: finding_geo.client_id, count(*)
   Group Key: finding_geo.client_id
   ->  Sort
         Output: finding_geo.client_id
         Sort Key: finding_geo.client_id
         ->  Foreign Scan on ead.finding_geo_public finding_geo
               Output: finding_geo.client_id
               Remote SQL: SELECT client_id FROM public.finding_geo_public WHERE ((sector = 'public')) AND ((status = 'open'))
(9 rows)


=== A query without the partition key fans out to every node ===
                          QUERY PLAN                          
--------------------------------------------------------------
 HashAggregate
   Group Key: finding_geo.office_code
   ->  Append
         ->  Seq Scan on finding_geo_ngo finding_geo_1
               Filter: (cvss_score >= '9'::numeric)
         ->  Seq Scan on finding_geo_private finding_geo_2
               Filter: (cvss_score >= '9'::numeric)
         ->  Foreign Scan on finding_geo_public finding_geo_3
(8 rows)

